                "We may now assemble a toy field equation and then refuse to worship it. Let a life contain whomps W₁, W₂, … separated by intervals Δt₁, Δt₂, …. Let L, aliveness, be a function not of the maximum W but of whether any Δt becomes so long that the organism forgets the sensation of being inhabited.",
